<title>USA: Intermet reorganizes sales, marketing.</title>
<headline>Intermet reorganizes sales, marketing.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intermet Corp, a manufacturer of ferrous castings, said Wednesday it reorganized its sales and marketing group into a single unit, effective immediately.</p>
<p>It said the marketing group of Wagner Casting Co, acquired in January, will be consolidated into the sales and marketing organization of Intermet, headquartered in Troy, Mich.</p>
<p>The company cited strategic reasons for the change.</p>
<p>	  ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
